    <briefdescription>
<para>Addressing + default state pair for a MUX control line. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One <computeroutput><ref refid="structmux__state" kindref="compound">mux_state</ref></computeroutput> pairs a <ref refid="structmux__control" kindref="compound">mux_control</ref> with a default state value extracted from the trailing cell of a devicetree <computeroutput>mux-states</computeroutput> specifier. Use <ref refid="group__mux__interface_1gad1b56b4430fca99f03bdf2b0ad6725c5" kindref="member">mux_state_apply()</ref> to drive the MUX to that state in one call. </para>
